{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-choice-8a-n4-29",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Compare supplied functions with four coordinate-plane parabola placements.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "New authored graph-recognition alternatives, not recovered source pixels. Each curve is y=a(x-h)^2+k. [{\"panel\":\"P\",\"sourcePart\":\"c\",\"a\":-2,\"h\":4,\"k\":-6},{\"panel\":\"Q\",\"sourcePart\":\"a\",\"a\":-2,\"h\":0,\"k\":0},{\"panel\":\"R\",\"sourcePart\":\"d\",\"a\":-2,\"h\":0,\"k\":8},{\"panel\":\"S\",\"sourcePart\":\"b\",\"a\":-2,\"h\":-3,\"k\":0}]. Shared mathematical range [-5,10,6,-16]; four separate equal-scale coordinate frames, no supplied function labels or vertex coordinates. Solid curve and vertex, two unit-offset sample points, dashed symmetry axis. Curves use exact quadratic Bezier geometry, not interpolated freehand strokes. Physical model-board fabrication and independent learner plotting remain untested.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n4",
        "exercise": "29",
        "text": "29. 利用抛物线$y=2x^2$的模型板作出下列方程的图象：\na) $y=-2x^2$；\nb) $y=-2(x+3)^2$；\nc) $y=-2(x-4)^2-6$；\nd) $y=-2x^2+8$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n4",
        "text": "类似地，可以证明，方程$y=a(x-m)^2+n$的图象一般是抛物线$y=ax^2$在平移（坐标原点映射到坐标为$(m,n)$的点）下的象.\n这里二次项系数不为零，变量取实数。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n4",
        "text": "抛物线有对称轴. 抛物线和它的对称轴的交点叫做抛物线的顶点. 对于抛物线$y=ax^2$来说，对称轴是$y$轴，顶点是点$O(0,0)$. 当$a>0$时，抛物线的“开口”向上，当$a<0$时向下."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n4",
        "text": "由平移的性质得出，函数$y=a(x-m)^2+n$的图象是和抛物线$y=ax^2$合同的抛物线，它的顶点是坐标为$(m,n)$的点，对称轴是直线$x=m$. 当$a>0$时抛物线的“开口”向上，当$a<0$时向下."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n4",
        "text": "前面的证明说明函数$y=a(x-m)^2+n$的图象是函数$y=ax^2$的图象在平移$\\overrightarrow{OO'}$下的象，其中$O$是坐标原点，$O'$是坐标为$(m,n)$的点. 类似地可以证明一般的结论，在给定的平移下，函数$y=f(x-m)+n$的图象是函数$y=f(x)$的图象的象.\n\n原函数的定义域也随横向位移平移，不能补入原来未定义的点。"
      }
    ],
